Subject: [PATCH 28/69] ARM: dts: iwg20m: Add watchdog support to SoM dtsi
Date: Fri, 18 May 2018 13:17:01 +0200
Message-Id: <fc9d3be893f8f175879657f844040d0722eb17fe.1526641667.git.horms+renesas@verge.net.au>
